  "body": "During migration, the partition state znodes written to ZooKeeper carry the KRaft controller epoch instead of the ZK one. ZK-mode code compares that field with its own controller epoch, so it should hold the ZK value.\n\nUse zkControllerEpoch() for those writes and add a test where the two epochs differ.",
